   1147  2845							; Enemies: half of them each frame (even slots on even frames, odd slots on
   1148  2845							; odd frames), so each moves in steps of two frames. Each walks left at its
   1149  2845							; kind's pace; a toy in its way stops it and gets chewed, except: the
   1150  2845							; helicopter hops over the first toy, the pogo frog jumps to the next shelf
   1151  2845							; once, the balloon clown floats over every toy, the T-Rex crushes a toy in
   1152  2845							; one bite. A jack-in-the-box springs on whatever reaches it; reaching the
   1153  2845							; toy box is a breach.
