   1530  2ad5							; Shots (even frames): each checks for a hit where it is, then moves one step
   1531  2ad5							; (six pixels) right along its shelf's diagonal; past x 149 it is gone
   1532  2ad5				   Shots
   1533  2ad5					      SUBROUTINE
   1534  2ad5		       a2 02		      ldx	#2
   1535  2ad7				   .loop
