   1564  2b0b							; ShotHit (X = shelf, lt0 = shot x): carry set if it hit an enemy
   1565  2b0b				   ShotHit
   1566  2b0b					      SUBROUTINE
   1567  2b0b		       a5 b1		      lda	lt0
