   1863  2d03							; Sound: channel 0 plays the player's actions and jingles, channel 1 combat.
   1864  2d03							; A sound is a list of steps (ticks of two frames, AUDC*16+AUDV, AUDF) ending
   1865  2d03							; in a zero; a new sound replaces the one playing on its channel unless that
   1866  2d03							; one matters more (SndPri).
   1867  2d03				   SndPlay		; A = sound id; keeps X and Y
   1868  2d03					      SUBROUTINE
